## [JetBrains Rider]
.idea/
*.sln.DotSettings

## [.NET / C#]
# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet symbol packages
*.snupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of Package Restore
**/[Pp]ackages/*
# except build/, which is used as an MSBuild target.
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
# Uncomment if using NuGet Type Mock
#**/[Pp]ackages/TypeMock.Intermediate/
# Empty folder/file package tracking
#**/[Pp]ackages/packages.config.xml

# Resource Manager code generated files
*.Designer.cs

# Backup and restore files from MSBuild
*.bak
*.cache
*.intermediate
*.old.sln
*.old.csproj

# BUnit test project output
TestResults/

## [OS Specific]
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

## [Avalonia]
# Avalonia uses standard .NET build outputs which are covered above.

## [Project Specific]
# Native libraries that are restored or bundled (if they shouldn't be in source control)
# Based on the file structure, runtimes/ contains SDL2 binaries.
# If these are part of the source control by intention, don't ignore them.
# Usually, they are restored via NuGet or should be kept if not available via NuGet.
# However, bin/ and obj/ are definitely to be ignored.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/nul
